1
00:00:00,062 --> 00:00:02,192
(Sheldon:)I guess we're done here.

2
00:00:06,194 --> 00:00:09,324
Here, drink-slash-eat this.

3
00:00:10,031 --> 00:00:13,071
- What is it?
- It's hot chocolate with a stick of butter.

4
00:00:15,077 --> 00:00:16,537
(Howard:)Okay, why?

5
00:00:16,704 --> 00:00:18,834
(Sheldon:)In the frigid temperatures
in the Arctic...

6
00:00:18,998 --> 00:00:22,538
...we need to consume 5000 calories
a day to maintain our body weight.

7
00:00:22,710 --> 00:00:25,380
(Leonard:)You know I can't eat butter.
I'm lactose intolerant.

8
00:00:25,546 --> 00:00:29,086
(Sheldon:)Way ahead of you. That's an
I Can't Believe It's Not Butter! stick.

9
00:00:29,592 --> 00:00:32,512
But, Mommy, all the other guys
are going to the North Pole.

10
00:00:32,678 --> 00:00:34,848
(Mrs Koothrappali:)I don't care
what the other guys are doing.

11
00:00:35,014 --> 00:00:37,264
(Mrs Koothrappali:)If the other guys jumped
in the Bay of Bengal...

12
00:00:37,433 --> 00:00:39,723
(Mrs Koothrappali:)...and tried to swim to Sri Lanka,
would you?

13
00:00:39,894 --> 00:00:43,064
(Raj:)If you were standing behind me nagging,
I might.

14
00:00:43,606 --> 00:00:46,896
(Dr Koothrappali:)Don't talk back to your mother.
This trip is much too dangerous.

15
00:00:47,068 --> 00:00:50,238
(Raj:)No, it's not. Howard, tell them.

16
00:00:50,571 --> 00:00:54,201
Dr. and Mrs. Koothrappali, namaste.

17
00:00:55,535 --> 00:00:56,955
I understand you're concerned.

18
00:00:57,119 --> 00:01:00,209
If it'll make you feel better,
my mother is fine with me going.

